{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2f8fb24c-f093-8078-b3aa-c2fda9bae0ae",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:20:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Celeste Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I need to report a drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clogged. Leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a clogged storm drain. Is it a catch basin in the street, like at a curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. At the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And where's the corner? What's the address you're near?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "242 Ruggles Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "242 Ruggles, that's up on the Hill, right? Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, writing that down. Two forty-two Ruggles Avenue, catch basin at the corner, clogged with leaves. What's it doing, is the water just sitting in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Backing up. Into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Into the driveway, okay. Is that happening right now, with the rain today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Since this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, this soaker's been steady since early. Has the water gotten near the house or the garage at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Driveway only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. That's something at least. Have you been able to do anything about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I cleared the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You went out and cleared it yourself? By hand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By hand. Leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And did that help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten minutes. Then it clogged again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:17:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, with leaves still coming down off the trees and the rain pushing them in, it'll do that. Appreciate you trying, though. I'll note that you cleared it and it clogged back up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:17:18-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me just read it back. Catch basin, corner by 242 Ruggles Avenue, blocked with leaves, water backing into your driveway, you cleared the grate by hand this morning and it only helped about ten minutes. That right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:17:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else about it? Is it a basin you've called about before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:17:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's always leaves. Every fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a leaf-season thing for a lot of the drains on the Hill. I'll put that in the notes too, that it's a recurring spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will there be a work order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm opening one as we speak. It goes to the crew that handles the drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's the part I can't pin down for you on this call. Today's a big rain day, so they're working through emergency calls first, flooded roads and the like. I can mark yours as water backing toward a property, which bumps it up a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:18:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "But what date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:18:39-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I don't have a scheduled date to give you right now. The work order gets a date once the crew supervisor assigns it, and that usually happens when they see what the storm leaves behind. Realistically I'd say once the rain eases off, but I can't promise a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can have someone call you back with the date once it's assigned. Is this the best number? Landline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-one. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Celeste Brito."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Brito, B-R-I-T-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:24-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Celeste. I'll flag it for a callback with the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You know, this is like that old radio show. Same thing, over and over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Which one, the one where nothing ever gets resolved?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That one. Every week, same problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Well, this time it's in writing, and the work order's tied to your number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:19:56-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the meantime, if the water starts coming toward the house, call us right back, or if it's an emergency, call 911. And stay out of the street water if you can, there's no telling what's in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:20:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can do for you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:20:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks for calling, Celeste. Stay dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:20:27-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
